          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Choose any three-digit number. Reverse the order of the digits.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now subtract the smaller number from the larger.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Show that your result is always divisible by 99 by trying several examples.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Justify that this will always be the case algebraically by letting the original three-digit number be ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "latex": "100a+10b+c",
              "display": false
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "Examples: $321-123=198=2\\times99$, $732-237=495=5\\times99$, $654-456=198=2\\times99$. In general, the larger-minus-smaller difference is $99|a-c|$, a multiple of 99.",
      "worked": {
        "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "id": "p24-q35-answer",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontSize": null,
            "align": "right",
            "spaceBefore": 0,
            "spaceAfter": 2,
            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Examples:",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{align*}321-123&=198\\quad(2\\times99)\\\\732-237&=495\\quad(5\\times99)\\\\654-456&=198\\quad(2\\times99)\\end{align*}",
                "display": true,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reversed number: ",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "100c+10b+a",
                "display": false,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "break"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Let ",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "D",
                "display": false,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " be the larger-minus-smaller difference. If ",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "a\\ge c",
                "display": false,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ":",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\begin{align*}D&=(100a+10b+c)-(100c+10b+a)\\\\D&=99a-99c\\\\D&=99(a-c)\\end{align*}",
                "display": true,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "If ",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "a<c",
                "display": false,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", reverse the subtraction order:",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "D=99(c-a)",
                "display": true,
                "colour": "#268cff"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Since a and c are digits, in either case the difference is 99 times a nonnegative integer, so it is always divisible by 99. Equal first and last digits give a difference of 0, which is also divisible by 99.",
                "marks": [],
                "colour": "#268cff"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
